### IPP-1202 live test of every role (after the live seed)
### Fill in the URLs and passwords at the top while testing, then put CHANGE_ME back. Never commit real passwords.
### Order: guest (1-5) -> free user (6-10) -> admin (11-14) -> paid user (15-18) -> blocked (19-21) -> clean up (22-23).
### First request can take ~1 minute (Render waking up).

@api = https://YOUR-RENDER-APP.onrender.com/api
@adminEmail = CHANGE_ME
@adminPassword = CHANGE_ME
### a verified test user (register it on the live site first, open the email link)
@userEmail = arsalmustafa62+ipp-live1@gmail.com
@userPassword = secret456

@userToken = {{userLogin.response.body.data.token}}
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.data.token}}
@userId = {{findUser.response.body.data.users[0]._id}}
@paidQuizId = {{paidQuiz.response.body.data.attemptId}}
@paidQ1 = {{paidQuiz.response.body.data.questions[0]._id}}


### ===== Guest =====

### 1. Health -> 200
GET {{api}}/health

### 2. Languages -> 200, PHP active (React only after you activate it)
GET {{api}}/languages

### 3. PHP Q&A as guest -> 200, hasFullAccess false; exactly 5 questions with isLocked false, the rest isLocked true (no answer)
GET {{api}}/questions?language=php&type=qa&limit=50

### 4. Quiz without login -> 401
POST {{api}}/quiz/start
Content-Type: application/json

{ "language": "php" }

### 5. Admin API without login -> 401
GET {{api}}/admin/stats


### ===== Free (unpaid) user =====

### 6. Login -> 200
# @name userLogin
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{userEmail}}", "password": "{{userPassword}}" }

### 7. Me -> isPaid false, role user
GET {{api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 8. Sample quiz -> 201 with 5 questions (the free MCQs) and no correct answers. Leave it; it auto-submits when time runs out.
POST {{api}}/quiz/start
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "language": "php" }

### 9. Bookmarks -> 403 (full access only)
GET {{api}}/bookmarks
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 10. Admin API as user -> 403
GET {{api}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### ===== Admin =====

### 11. Admin login -> 200, data.user.role "admin"
# @name adminLogin
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{adminEmail}}", "password": "{{adminPassword}}" }

### 12. Stats -> 200 with counts (PHP 20 Q&A + 20 MCQs, React 100 + 60 if uploaded)
GET {{api}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 13. Find the test user
# @name findUser
GET {{api}}/admin/users?search={{userEmail}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 14. Give full access -> 200, isPaid true
PUT {{api}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/access
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isPaid": true }


### ===== Paid user (same user, same token) =====

### 15. Me -> isPaid true
GET {{api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 16. All answers open -> every question isLocked false
GET {{api}}/questions?language=php&type=qa&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 17. Full quiz -> 201 with 6 questions
# @name paidQuiz
POST {{api}}/quiz/start
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "language": "php", "difficulty": "mixed" }

### 18. Bookmark a question -> 200 (send again to remove it)
POST {{api}}/bookmarks/{{paidQ1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### ===== Blocked user =====

### 19. Block -> 200 "... is blocked"
PUT {{api}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/block
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isBlocked": true }

### 20. Blocked user's old token -> 403, code ACCOUNT_BLOCKED
GET {{api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 21. Blocked user login -> 403 "Your account has been blocked..."
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{userEmail}}", "password": "{{userPassword}}" }


### ===== Clean up =====

### 22. Unblock -> 200
PUT {{api}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/block
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isBlocked": false }

### 23. Remove full access again (or keep it for the client demo) -> 200, isPaid false
PUT {{api}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/access
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isPaid": false }
